<title>BELGIUM: CCB to hold 1600 GMT news conference.</title>
<headline>CCB to hold 1600 GMT news conference.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian bank Credit Communal/ Gemeentekrediet (CCB), the Belgian arm of Franco-Belgian banking group Dexia, will hold a news conference at 1700 local (1600 GMT), a spokesman for the group said.</p>
<p>The news conference will coincide with one at CCB's French partner Credit Local de France Paris headquarters.</p>
<p>The CCB spokesman declined to say what it was about. From France, Dexia said that CLF's Pierre Richard would announce &quot;an important financial operation&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
